<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ublock-Origin on knowledge base</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/tags/ublock-origin/</link><description>Recent content in Ublock-Origin on knowledge base</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><managingEditor>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</managingEditor><webMaster>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 23 Nov 2021 14:43:52 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kbs.yinagi.in/tags/ublock-origin/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Ublock Origin Youtube Filter List</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/6e225c364f36afa1b5766490db9e7229/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 Nov 2021 14:43:52 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/6e225c364f36afa1b5766490db9e7229/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;So idea here is to reduce the distraction. One thought that was difficult for me to overcame was&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I should have self-control, no such controls are needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have less distraction and making bad habits(imo) difficult is powerful way to stay more focussed in case I drift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It primarily removes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Videos on Home page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggested videos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comments (Wasted time reading it, and endup think, why in this world did I read them).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3 id="steps"&gt;Steps&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Go to filters pane: &lt;a href="https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock/wiki/Dashboard:-My-filters"&gt;https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock/wiki/Dashboard:-My-filters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add content to filters from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!Home page all videos page
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;youtube.com##ytd-browse.ytd-page-manager.style-scope
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!Suggestion by youtube
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;youtube.com###related
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;!Removes comments
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;##.ytd-comments.style-scope
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>